The azhyphen package is distributed under the LaTeX Project Public License,
version 1.3c or (at your option) any later version.

The license text is available at
https://www.latex-project.org/lppl/lppl-1-3c.txt and is included in TeX Live
as `lppl1.3c.txt`.

The package has the LPPL maintenance status "maintained". The Current
Maintainer is the azhyphen project maintainer. The maintained files are all
files in this repository except imported pattern data whose notices state
otherwise. In particular, the maintained runtime files are:

  tex/latex/azhyphen/azhyphen.sty
  tex/latex/azhyphen/azhyphen.lua
  tex/latex/azhyphen/azhyphen.hyp.txt
  tex/latex/azhyphen/azhyphen-xetex.tex

Imported `azhyphen.pat.txt` data may carry an additional compatible copyright
notice supplied by its source project.
